{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "\"%@\" が \"%@\" でした。\n\"%@\" を返すようにしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"%1$@\" was \"%2$@\".\nReturn \"%3$@\" instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"%@\" が届きました。ちょうど \"%@\" にしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Received \"%1$@\". Change it to exactly \"%2$@\"."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"%@\" が届きました。ちょうど %@ にしてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Received \"%1$@\". Change it to exactly %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@\n…（先頭だけ表示しています。全 %lld バイト）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@\n… (showing the beginning only; %2$lld bytes in total)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ がサーバに届いていません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ did not reach the server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ にHTTPプロキシの設定は入っていますが、その先が応答しません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An HTTP proxy is set to %@, but nothing is responding there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ の中身が暗号化されたままです。\n中身を読めない状態では、ルールを正しく組んでもレスポンスは変わりません。\nTools → SSL Proxying List… の Include List に %@ を追加してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The content of %1$@ is still encrypted.\nWhile the content can't be read, the response won't change no matter how correctly you set up the rule.\nIn Tools → SSL Proxying List…, add %2$@ to the Include List."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ の新しい値": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New value for %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ は通っていて、Proxyman の一覧にも出ます。ただし中身は暗号化されたままで読めません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Traffic goes through %@ and shows up in Proxyman's list, but the content is still encrypted and can't be read."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ をコピー": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 秒 / 最大 %@ 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ s / max %2$@ s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 秒（baseline の %@ 倍）。回線を絞れています。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ s (%2$@× the baseline). The connection is throttled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@で Scripting → Script List… を開く。Scripting は Tools の中ではなく、独立したメニュー。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@, choose Script List… from the Scripting menu. Scripting is its own menu, not part of Tools."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@で Tools → Breakpoint → Rules… を開く。Breakpoint はサブメニューで、その中の Rules… が設定画面。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@, choose Rules… from Tools → Breakpoint. Breakpoint is a submenu, and Rules… inside it opens the settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@で `Tools` → `Block List…` を開く。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@, choose `Block List…` from the `Tools` menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@で `Tools` → `Breakpoint` → `Rules…` を開く。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@, choose `Rules…` from `Tools` → `Breakpoint`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@で `Tools` → `Map Local…` を開く。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@, choose `Map Local…` from the `Tools` menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@で `Tools` → `Map Remote…` を開く。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@, choose `Map Remote…` from the `Tools` menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@で `Tools` → `Network Conditions…` を開く。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In %@, choose `Network Conditions…` from the `Tools` menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld / %lld クリア": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld / %2$lld cleared"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 件のうちに id=%lld は見つかりませんでした。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "id=%2$lld was not found among the %1$lld items."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 件のリクエストを送りました。Proxyman で特定のリクエストを検索してください。\n手順どおりに絞り込みの欄で 1 件まで絞り、その `%@` を読んでください。\n読み取った 4 文字を`答え合わせ`の欄に入れると判定します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sent %1$lld requests. Find the specific one in Proxyman.\nFollow the steps to narrow the list down to one request with the filter field, then read its `%2$@`.\nEnter the 4 characters you read in the `Check Answer` field to check."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 件をまとめて送っています。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sending %lld requests at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 MB をダウンロードしています。回線を絞っているぶん時間がかかります。そのままお待ちください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloading 1 MB. It takes longer because the connection is throttled. Please wait."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "<%lld バイトのバイナリ>": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "<%lld bytes of binary data>"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "API の向き先を切り替える": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch the API destination"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Action で `Block` を選ぶ。`Hide, but not Block` は一覧から隠すだけで、通信は遮断されない。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose `Block` for Action. `Hide, but not Block` only hides it from the list and doesn't block the traffic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Breakpoints ウィンドウ下段の Response 欄で Other タブを開く。Status Code の欄をクリックし、%lld から %lld に変更する。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the Response pane at the bottom of the Breakpoints window, open the Other tab. Click the Status Code field and change it from %1$lld to %2$lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP %@ が返りました。まだ遮断されていません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Got HTTP %@. The request is not blocked yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTP %lld が届きました。200 に書き換えてください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Got HTTP %lld. Change it to 200."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HTTPプロキシに繋がりません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't reach the HTTP proxy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Host（両方）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host (both)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JSON本文を map-local.json として保存し、File の Select Local File で選ぶ。Proxyman がこのJSONをレスポンス本文として返す。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save the JSON body as map-local.json and choose it with Select Local File under File. Proxyman returns this JSON as the response body."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac で Proxyman を起動してください。起動するだけでHTTPプロキシが設定され、シミュレータで通信することができます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Launch Proxyman on the Mac. Launching it sets the HTTP proxy, so the simulator's traffic goes through it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac で Proxyman を起動する。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Launch Proxyman on the Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac の Proxyman が起動していません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxyman is not running on the Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac の Proxyman で `Certificate` → `Install Certificate on iOS` → `Physical Devices…` を開き、証明書をインストールする。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Proxyman on the Mac, open `Certificate` → `Install Certificate on iOS` → `Physical Devices…` and install the certificate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac の Proxyman で `Certificate` → `Install Certificate on iOS` → `Simulators…` を開き、証明書をインストールしたあと、シミュレータを再起動する。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Proxyman on the Mac, open `Certificate` → `Install Certificate on iOS` → `Simulators…`, install the certificate, then restart the simulator."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac の Proxyman で `Tools` → `SSL Proxying List…` を開き、`Include List` の「+」を押して、下の `Domain` を貼り付けて `Add` する。`Enable SSL Proxying Tool` が ON になっていることを確認する。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Proxyman on the Mac, open `Tools` → `SSL Proxying List…`, press “+” under `Include List`, paste the `Domain` below, and press `Add`. Make sure `Enable SSL Proxying Tool` is ON."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac の Proxyman で、このアプリが送信したリクエストと受信したレスポンスを読むことができます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can read the requests this app sent and the responses it received in Proxyman on the Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac の Proxyman に切り替え、左のサイドバーの `Domains` から postman-echo.com を選ぶ。一覧がこのドメインの通信だけになる。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch to Proxyman on the Mac and select postman-echo.com under `Domains` in the left sidebar. The list now shows only this domain's traffic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac のシステム設定で IP アドレスが表示されている場所": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where the IP address is shown in System Settings on the Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 上で Proxyman が起動しているか確認してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check that Proxyman is running on the Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map From と Map To の Host の欄に、この値を入れる。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter this value in the Host field of both Map From and Map To."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map From と Map To の Path の欄に、この値を入れる。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter this value in the Path field of both Map From and Map To."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map From と Map To の Protocol の欄に、この値を入れる。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter this value in the Protocol field of both Map From and Map To."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map From の Query": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map From Query"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map From の Query の欄に、この値を入れる。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter this value in the Query field of Map From."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map To の Query": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Map To Query"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Map To の Query の欄に、この値を入れる。ここだけが Map From と違う。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter this value in the Query field of Map To. This is the only field that differs from Map From."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matching Rule の欄に、この値を入れる。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter this value in the Matching Rule field."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matching Rule の欄に、この値を入れる。他のレッスンとパスが違うので、有効のままでも邪魔にならない。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter this value in the Matching Rule field. Its path differs from the other lessons, so it won't get in the way even if left enabled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matching Rule の種類を Wildcard にし、URL の欄にこの値を入れる。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set the Matching Rule type to Wildcard and enter this value in the URL field."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matching Rule の種類を Wildcard にし、この値を入れる。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set the Matching Rule type to Wildcard and enter this value."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matching Rule（Wildcard）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matching Rule (Wildcard)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matching URLs の種類を Wildcard にし、その欄にこの値を入れる。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set the Matching URLs type to Wildcard and enter this value in that field."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Matching URLs（Wildcard）:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matching URLs (Wildcard):"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Path（両方）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Path (both)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Protocol（両方）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Protocol (both)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ProxyLab": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ProxyLab"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxyman が通信を止めています。Breakpoints ウィンドウで書き換えて Execute を押すまで待ち続けます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxyman has paused the request. It keeps waiting until you edit it in the Breakpoints window and press Execute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxyman での手順": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steps in Proxyman"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxyman で読み取った `%@` の値を入れてください。送り直す必要はありません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the `%@` value you read in Proxyman. You don't need to send the request again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxyman の Headers タブで %@ を探し、%@ をこの値（%@）に実際に書き換える。下のボタンが緑のチェックに変わるのはこのアプリでのコピー済み表示で、Proxyman 側の書き換えが済んだという意味ではない。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the Headers tab in Proxyman, find %1$@ and actually change %2$@ to this value (%3$@). The button below turning into a green check only means it was copied in this app, not that the value was changed in Proxyman."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxyman のメニューバー（画面最上部）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proxyman's menu bar (at the very top of the screen)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Proxyman 上の値が %@ になったことを確認して、`Execute` を押して送信を再開する。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make sure the value in Proxyman is now %@, then press `Execute` to resume sending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Script Editor に貼り付ける。レスポンスに %@ という配列を生やし、手で書けない量のデータをコードで作る。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste this into the Script Editor. It adds an array named %@ to the response, generating more data with code than you could write by hand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "URL（Wildcard）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "URL (Wildcard)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi に繋がっているか確認してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check that you're connected to Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Xcode の実行先に iPhone Simulator を選び、`Run`（⌘R）でアプリを起動する。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose an iPhone Simulator as the run destination in Xcode and launch the app with `Run` (⌘R)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`\"%@\"` の行を探し、`%@` をこの値に実際に書き換える。`%@` の行はそのままでよい。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Find the `\"%1$@\"` line and actually change `%2$@` to this value. Leave the `%3$@` line as is."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`Breakpoint` で `Request` にチェックを入れる。`Response` のチェックは外しておく。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check `Request` under `Breakpoint`. Leave `Response` unchecked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`Breakpoint` で `Response` にチェックを入れる。`Request` のチェックは外しておく。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check `Response` under `Breakpoint`. Leave `Request` unchecked."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`Done` を押す。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press `Done`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`Done` を押す。この画面のボタンは `Save` ではなく `Done`。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press `Done`. The button on this screen is `Done`, not `Save`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`Enable Network Conditions` を ON にし、そのルールの `Enable Rule` も ON にする。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on `Enable Network Conditions`, and turn on `Enable Rule` for that rule too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`Enable Scripting Tool` と、そのルールの `Enable Rule` が ON になっていることを確認する。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make sure `Enable Scripting Tool` and the rule's `Enable Rule` are ON."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`Execute` を押して送信を再開する。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press `Execute` to resume sending."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`Execute` を押す。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press `Execute`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "`File` の `Select Local File` を押し、保存した map-local.json を選ぶ。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
